message: "If you use or reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Hegyesy Prime Mesh R2Q ThetaBridge Certificate v1"
abstract: >
  A reproducible certificate-level closure for the active theta bridge
  G(x) = theta(x) - x against the RH-scale envelope
  1.9233607946440099 * sqrt(x) * log(x)^2.
  The package provides a one-command audit runner that reproduces PASS
  for all post-P0 first-exit obstruction checks, including coordinate-gap
  normalized margin safety (141/141), ThresholdRelevance (10140 rows / 0 failures),
  candidate window coverage (142/142), and local obstruction closure.
  This constitutes a certificate-level route toward the Chebyshev/von Koch
  RH-scale criterion, pending independent mathematical verification.
